## 2) Landed DE (observed WT — not committed this agent)

### 2a) `ooda/std/os/process.oo` (CAP-G4 product facade)

- `process_spawn` / `process_wait` / `process_kill` / `process_exec` → **`&ProcessCap`**
- `process_epoll_create` / `process_inotify_init` / `process_prctl` → **`&SysCap`** (hard residual)
- Header documents SysCap supersede soft-granular + ProcessCap↛hard Sys
- Residual honesty: spawn/wait/kill still **Err residual** after cap re-check; real path = `process_exec` → `sys_exec`

### 2b) Dual-tree async split

- `spawn_task(proc: &ProcessCap, …)` → `async_spawn_internal`
- `join_task(sys: &SysCap, …)` → `async_join_internal` (**hard SysCap-only**)
- Product + external **byte-identical**

### 2c) Dual-tree python hard residual

- `load_model(sys: &SysCap, …)` stays SysCap (CAP-G4: `python_embed*` hard Sys)
- Comments forbid ProcessCap migrate of embed path
- Product + external **byte-identical**

